# Fleet work assignments for the dispatch recipe.
# Copy to assignments.csv (gitignored) and fill in your assignments.
#
# Format: hostname,start_date,end_date,collectors
#   hostname   — must match a hostname in fleet.csv
#   start_date — YYYYMMDD
#   end_date   — YYYYMMDD (inclusive)
#   collectors — RIS range notation (e.g. rrc00-rrc12)
#
# One line = one tmux session (slice-STARTDATE-ENDDATE) on that host.
# The session iterates through dates serially within its range.
# Multiple lines per host = multiple parallel sessions on that host.
# Use discontinuous ranges freely — just add more lines.
#
# User and repo path are read from fleet.csv (not duplicated here).
#
# hostname,start_date,end_date,collectors
node1.example.com,20260701,20260715,rrc00-rrc12
node1.example.com,20260720,20260725,rrc00-rrc12
node2.example.com,20260716,20260719,rrc13-rrc25
node2.example.com,20260726,20260731,rrc13-rrc25
mac.local,20260801,20260831,rrc00-rrc25
